    "This manual covers the interface and basic operations of the Disk Manager: viewing disk usage, scanning for large files and caches, and cleaning them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This manual covers the interface and basic operations of the Disk Manager: viewing disk usage, scanning for large files and caches, and cleaning them."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本手册介绍磁盘管理器的界面与基本操作:查看磁盘使用情况、扫描大文件与缓存并予以清理。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本手冊介紹磁碟管理器的介面與基本操作:查看磁碟使用情況、掃描大檔案與快取並予以清理。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
